# Route: guide 26 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 45 to 47, 26
# quests, 3.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris): Gadgetzan -> Noonshade Ruins -> Steamwheedle Port ->
# Waterspring Field -> Lost Rigger Cove -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan ->
# Waterspring Field -> Noonshade Ruins -> Gadgetzan -> Sandsorrow Watch ->
# Gadgetzan -> The Noxious Lair -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2771 A Good
# Head On Your Shoulders; 2772 The World At Your Feet; 2773 The Mithril Kid;
# 3321 Did You Lose This?; 3638 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3639 Show Your Work;
# 3644 Membership Card Renewal; 6610 Clamlette Surprise; 7652 A Blue Light
# Bargain; 7653 Imperial Plate Belt; 7654 Imperial Plate Boots; 7655 Imperial
# Plate Bracer; 7656 Imperial Plate Chest; 7657 Imperial Plate Helm; 7658
# Imperial Plate Leggings; 7659 Imperial Plate Shoulders.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788).

